From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] opcservices: read packages, stream methods, deletion, relationship queries, URI compare (3545)

opcservices: ReadPackageFromStream, stream methods, part/relationship deletion, relationship enumeration by type, URI compare and relative references

IOpcFactory::ReadPackageFromStream reads zip packages (stored and deflated entries, CRC checked), [Content_Types].xml,
part relationships and package relationships. The part content stream and the file stream implement SetSize, CopyTo,
Commit, Revert, Lock/UnlockRegion, Stat and Clone (content stream writes into the middle no longer corrupt the size).
IOpcPartSet::DeletePart, IOpcRelationshipSet::DeleteRelationship, GetEnumeratorForType, GetRelationshipsContentStream,
IOpcPartUri::GetRelativeUri and ComparePartUri. The target mode of a relationship is stored and written. An unknown class
gives CLASS_E_CLASSNOTAVAILABLE.
